   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 111.06,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "第二，在验证集上给候选打分。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 114.91,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "第三，挑分数最好的那个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 118.15,
   "dur": 2.2,
   "speech": "听起来很直白。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 120.53,
   "dur": 2.44,
   "speech": "但每一步都有坑。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 123.14,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "先说候选从哪来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 125.88,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "有人手写，有人按经验抄。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 129.22,
   "dur": 2.94,
   "speech": "也有人让机器自己搜。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 132.34,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "最后一条叫自动化模型设计。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 135.9,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "两条路线，搜索和元学习。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 139.35,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "搜索是在参数空间里找。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 142.69,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "元学习是拿别的任务的经验。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 146.13,
   "dur": 2.41,
   "speech": "这一集只做搜索。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 148.72,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "搜索的第一步是定义空间。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 151.99,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "空间里有什么，决定你能找到什么。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 155.64,
   "dur": 3.21,
   "speech": "文献里把这一步叫配置空间。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 159.02,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "空间定小了，最优解根本不在里面。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 163.03,
   "dur": 3.21,
   "speech": "空间定大了，算力就烧起来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 166.42,
   "dur": 3.35,
   "speech": "所以空间本身就是一个决策。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 169.95,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "定义空间要写清楚三件事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 173.43,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "哪些超参、取值范围、约束。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 177.18,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "比如 SARIMA 有七个可调项。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 180.73,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "阶数 p 和 q，差分 d 和 D。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 184.43,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "季节周期 m，季节阶数 P 和 Q。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 188.46,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "每个都取小范围，组合就爆炸。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 192.11,
   "dur": 2.82,
   "speech": "这就是第二件事：怎么搜。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 195.11,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "穷举、随机、进化、代理模型。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 199.36,
   "dur": 3.18,
   "speech": "不同策略花的时间差几十倍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 202.73,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "第三件事：怎么判断谁赢。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 205.94,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "判断要用验证集，不能用测试集。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 209.93,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "测试集只能用来看最终结果。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 213.48,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "这条纪律在本集里贯穿到底。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 217.06,
   "dur": 3.35,
   "speech": "所以标准答案是这样定义的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 220.59,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "十个候选，每个都完整训练。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 224.05,
   "dur": 2.68,
   "speech": "在测试集上算误差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 226.91,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "误差最小的那个，就是真值最优。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 230.75,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speech": "注意这是事后视角。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 233.49,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "真实决策的时候，你看不到测试集。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 237.35,
   "dur": 2.99,
   "speech": "选模型就是猜这个真值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 243.74,
   "dur": 2.49,
   "speech": "先把指标写清楚。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 246.41,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "第一类指标量误差有多大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 249.84,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "平均绝对误差，简称 MAE。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 253.18,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "把每个点的误差取绝对值，再平均。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 257.16,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "均方误差，简称 MSE。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 260.57,
   "dur": 2.46,
   "speech": "先平方，再平均。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 263.22,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "speech": "平方放大残差，所以 MSE 更怕异常点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 268.14,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "开根号就是 RMSE。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 271.48,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "RMSE 和原序列同量纲。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 275.13,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "三个指标口径不同，排序也可能不同。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 279.21,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "第四种是百分比误差，MAPE。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 282.71,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "误差除以真值，再取平均百分比。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 286.63,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "真值接近零时，分母会炸。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 289.89,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "所以要先跳过近零样本。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 293.21,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "第五种是 Accuracy@k。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 296.62,
   "dur": 3.35,
   "speech": "预测 k 个候选，看命中几个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 300.15,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "这一集只用它做黄金值检查。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 303.61,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "日线预测更关心误差，不关心排序。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 307.62,
   "dur": 3.11,
   "speech": "指标选错，冠军就换人。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 310.91,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "这句话后面有数字支撑。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 314.17,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speech": "第二组指标量选择对不对。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 317.15,
   "dur": 2.63,
   "speech": "定义真值最优为 t。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 319.96,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "一个池子挑出来的叫 a 帽。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 323.44,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "如果 a 帽等于 t，记一次命中。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 326.95,
   "dur": 2.99,
   "speech": "这个比例叫 Hit@1。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 330.12,
   "dur": 3.81,
   "speech": "放宽到前两名，叫 Hit@2。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 334.1,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "真值最优在池里的名次，取平均。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 337.9,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "这个数叫 Average Rank。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 340.92,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "它比 Hit@1 更细，因为用了名次。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 344.96,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "三个数一起看，才知道选择器好不好。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 348.87,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "第三组指标是给网格搜索用的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 352.62,
   "dur": 2.94,
   "speech": "赤池信息量，AIC。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 355.74,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "公式是 2k 减 2 倍对数似然。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 359.7,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "k 是参数个数，越大罚得越狠。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 363.45,
   "dur": 2.94,
   "speech": "似然用高斯残差近似。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 366.57,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "同一个样本上，AIC 随残差平方和单调。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 371.18,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "所以它和 MSE 的口径一致。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 374.69,
   "dur": 2.68,
   "speech": "黄金值是 206。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 377.54,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "speech": "参数三个、对数似然负一百，正好 206。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 382.47,
   "dur": 2.87,
   "speech": "这一条在测试里钉死了。"
  },
  {
